mindmap
root((where the reading method lives))
  the question it answers
    what does this report mean
    why did the verdict come out this way
    which field do I act on
    what does it not prove
  why not fold it into the core skill
    the catalog row is truncated at five hundred characters
    the core row already spends its budget on verification triggers
      a reading trigger pushed in would fall past the cut
    a trigger nobody can see routes nowhere
      the match is literal, so wording matters
    the pointer is one way, and deliberately
      this row names the core skill as the producer
      the core row has no budget left for a back pointer
        adding one would push it past the truncation
      the gate needs only one side to name the other
      the corpus decides the boundary, in utterances
  why it is a skill and not a tool
    no field is missing from the reports
      reportView already selects digest or full
      report_diff already compares two of them
    a tool would restate the guidance it is meant to deliver
    the method is prose about fields that already exist
  what it owns
    the reading order
    where each family keeps its findings
    severity before code
    the two easy misreadings
  what it does not own
    how to produce a model, that is the core skill
    any per-domain check, that is the domain skill
    what a check proves about the code
  what it ships with
    the guide as a reference beside it
    the map that structures the guide
    a test that regenerates both and compares
